 "scope": "PR5087 projection_20261124 qualification-01; p=2147483647; one unique coupled Semaev fixture; 13 new analytic library test groups and 3 new CLI test groups; immutable copied source and qualifiers; producer-local observation only",
 "statement": "Producer-local native M31 projection qualification: the first frozen attempt passed 40 library and 5 CLI tests. The existing unique m3 case0 geometric sequential fixture returned exactly {(0,0)} matching the separate signed-point oracle after original-ideal Buchberger checking. Projection used 6 queries, 29 leading-term iterations and 28 polynomial subtractions at degree at most 2. Coupled F4 retained 561 pairs, 10 matrices and observed raw/post-normal-form degree 6. Analytic controls cover all16 section supports, nonreduced, extension and infinity fibers, forged bases and resource limits. Executable hashes matched before/after. No full 50-case-per-configuration solver cohort, matched timing/RSS measurement or signed execution standing is asserted."
